{"version":1,"content":"<p>《塞爾達：時之笛 重製版》呈現十五項變化，涵蓋角色配音、操作方式、場景探索、畫面細節和地圖佈局。關鍵角色及重要過場將採用完整配音，但林克仍然保持沉默。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1584984.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T07:25:59.024566+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":80,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T07:02:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T07:18:37.987128+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T07:18:37.987128+00:00","content_hash":"c6c36f06a7505a95285112e0ff3b99103828680aa5577cd1500f0c0d8fde0602","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}